# DSM - Count Olywier Rabenau's Crescent Charter
job-name-pretorian-knight = Pretorian Knight
job-description-pretorian-knight = Serve as an elite noble guardsman. Protect the charter's highest authorities and the person entrusted to your charge.

job-name-regent-empire = Charter Regent
job-description-regent-empire = Exercise delegated authority under Count Olywier's seal when the charter requires a resident regent. Defend recognized holdings, preserve solvency, and conduct diplomacy without claiming the Crown's powers as your own.
